{"pages":[{"w":612,"ocr":false,"h":792,"segs":[["R E L AT I O N A L E VA N G E L I S M 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,620.18600000000004,9,false],["RELATIONAL",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,370.46000000000004,116.00059999999996,80,false],["EVANGELISM",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,382.77999999999997,176.00059999999996,80,false],["separating ourselves from those we are seeking to",370.20299999999997,225.39289999999994,557.91600000000005,237.79489999999998,9,false],["reach.",370.20299999999997,238.38889999999992,393.59399999999999,250.79089999999997,9,false],["Jesus was often criticized by the religious leaders of",370.20299999999997,264.3898999999999,566.82600000000002,276.79189999999994,9,false],["His day for associating with tax collectors and sinners.",370.20299999999997,277.38589999999999,575.97000000000003,289.78789999999998,9,false],["His response revealed both His heart for and pursuit",370.20299999999997,290.38189999999997,568.55400000000009,302.78389999999996,9,false],["of the lost: “It is not the healthy who need a doctor,",370.20299999999997,303.37789999999995,560.42700000000013,315.77989999999994,9,false],["but the sick. I have not come to call the righteous, but",370.20299999999997,316.37389999999994,570.30900000000008,328.77589999999992,9,false],["sinners” (Mark 2:17).",370.20299999999997,329.36989999999992,450.53699999999998,341.7718999999999,9,false],["Why is it that many Christians become frustrated",146.40000000000001,355.43489999999997,334.13100000000009,367.83689999999996,9,false],["and don’t follow through when they are asked to bring",146.40000000000001,368.43089999999995,349.40400000000011,380.83289999999994,9,false],["their friends to an outreach event, or to tell their",146.40000000000001,381.42689999999993,328.7940000000001,393.82889999999992,9,false],["friends about Christ? Maybe it’s because we don’t",146.40000000000001,394.42289999999991,333.59100000000001,406.8248999999999,9,false],["know many non-Christians and those we do know,",146.40000000000003,407.41889999999989,337.12800000000004,419.82089999999988,9,false],["we consider to be acquaintances rather than friends.",146.40000000000003,420.41489999999988,344.83200000000011,432.81689999999986,9,false],["This makes it even more difficult to bridge the gap to",146.40000000000003,433.41089999999986,344.34600000000023,445.81289999999984,9,false],["spiritual issues. Have Christians become cocooned?",146.40000000000003,446.40689999999984,343.02300000000014,458.80889999999982,9,false],["As Christians, our mission is to reach out into the",370.20299999999997,355.37089999999989,556.98900000000015,367.77289999999988,9,false],["world around us and love people into a lifechanging",370.20299999999997,368.36689999999987,564.32400000000007,380.76889999999986,9,false],["relationship with Christ. The following steps are",370.20299999999997,381.36289999999985,554.22600000000011,393.76489999999984,9,false],["principles for building bridges of friendship with lost",370.20299999999997,394.35889999999984,570.99300000000005,406.76089999999982,9,false],["students.",370.20299999999997,407.35489999999982,405.22199999999998,419.7568999999998,9,false],["HEART OF THE MATTER",146.40000000000001,478.81990000000002,244.52000000000004,499.35990000000004,20,false],["Cocooning was a buzzword of the ‘80s. VCRs and",146.40000000000001,498.43490000000003,331.08900000000011,510.83690000000001,9,false],["Domino’s Pizza have made it possible for people",146.40000000000001,511.43090000000001,327.54300000000012,523.8329,9,false],["to spin a web of safety and security in their own",146.40000000000001,524.42689999999993,325.81500000000005,536.82889999999998,9,false],["comfortable environment rather than venture out into",146.40000000000001,537.42290000000003,351.88800000000003,549.82489999999996,9,false],["the world.",146.40000000000001,550.41890000000001,184.66800000000001,562.82089999999994,9,false],["Sometimes Christians cocoon into spiritual",146.40000000000001,576.41989999999998,312.24299999999999,588.82190000000003,9,false],["safety and security rather than take risks to build",146.40000000000001,589.41589999999997,331.93500000000006,601.81790000000001,9,false],["relationships with the lost. We fill our evenings with",146.40000000000001,602.41190000000006,343.82400000000013,614.81389999999999,9,false],["Bible studies, fill our lives with Christian friends and",146.40000000000001,615.40790000000004,345.89400000000012,627.80989999999997,9,false],["end up isolating ourselves from the very culture to",146.40000000000001,628.40390000000002,336.20100000000002,640.80590000000007,9,false],["which we were called to be salt and light.",146.40000000000001,641.39990000000012,299.97600000000011,653.80190000000005,9,false],["The Christian community should be a place from",146.40000000000001,667.40090000000009,332.05200000000008,679.80290000000002,9,false],["which we can confidently go out into battle building",146.40000000000001,680.39690000000007,341.84400000000005,692.7989,9,false],["common-ground relationships with the lost. It should",146.40000000000001,693.39290000000005,349.63800000000003,705.7949000000001,9,false],["not be our fortress where we hide from the world",146.40000000000001,706.38890000000004,331.08000000000004,718.79090000000008,9,false],["STEPS TO TAKE",370.20000000000005,439.81989999999996,434.82000000000005,460.35989999999998,20,false],["1. Make new friends",370.20000000000005,459.1019,454.12500000000006,472.48489999999998,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,472.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,484.83689999999996,9,false],["Make a list of unreached friends.",388.20000000000005,472.43489999999997,511.9140000000001,484.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,485.43490000000003,374.34000000000003,497.83690000000001,9,false],["Get involved in common ground activities such",388.20000000000005,485.43490000000003,566.81400000000008,497.83690000000001,9,false],["as intramurals, band, greek system, clubs, etc.",388.20000000000005,498.43090000000001,560.27100000000007,510.8329,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,511.43490000000003,374.34000000000003,523.83690000000001,9,false],["Be yourself and have fun.",388.20000000000005,511.43490000000003,482.88000000000005,523.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,536.83690000000001,9,false],["Remember there are lots of morally neutral",388.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,551.9910000000001,536.83690000000001,9,false],["places you can go and things you can do with non-",388.20000000000005,537.43090000000007,575.76900000000012,549.8329,9,false],["Christians.",388.20000000000005,550.42690000000005,430.52700000000004,562.82889999999998,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,563.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,575.83690000000001,9,false],["Study the life of Christ; He was a friend of",388.20000000000005,563.43489999999997,545.70000000000005,575.83690000000001,9,false],["sinners.",388.20000000000005,576.43090000000007,418.57500000000005,588.8329,9,false],["2. Pray",370.20000000000005,602.09889999999996,399.31500000000005,615.4819,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,615.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,627.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray consistently for your new friends.",388.20000000000005,615.43489999999997,535.05300000000011,627.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,628.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,640.83690000000001,9,false],["Ask God for sincere compassion (Mark 9:36).",388.20000000000005,628.43489999999997,559.04700000000003,640.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,641.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,653.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray for God’s Spirit to work in their hearts (John",388.20000000000005,641.43489999999997,575.79600000000016,653.83690000000001,9,false],["16:7-11).",388.20000000000005,654.43089999999995,419.88900000000007,666.8329,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,667.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,679.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray for open doors and opportunities",388.20000000000005,667.43489999999997,532.2360000000001,679.83690000000001,9,false],["(Colossians 4:3).",388.20000000000005,680.43089999999995,451.49700000000007,692.8329,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,705.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray for their salvation (Romans 10:1, 1 Timothy",388.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,571.10700000000008,705.83690000000001,9,false],["2:1-7).",388.20000000000005,706.43089999999995,412.19400000000007,718.8329,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]]},{"segs":[["•",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Imagine a group of 10 believers praying for 10",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,336.04800000000012,45.836899999999901,9,false],["people each. That would be 100 non-Christians",164.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,343.37400000000014,58.832899999999881,9,false],["being prayed for!",164.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,228.327,71.828899999999862,9,false],["3. Give yourself",146.40000000000001,85.094899999999825,211.99200000000002,98.477899999999863,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,110.8368999999999,9,false],["Be a good conversationalist and friend.",164.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,311.13600000000002,110.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,123.8368999999999,9,false],["Be available in the hard times.",164.40000000000001,111.43489999999986,277.83600000000001,123.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,136.8368999999999,9,false],["Enjoy being with them without having an agenda.",164.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,351.38400000000013,136.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,149.8368999999999,9,false],["Focus on their heart, not their actions. Don’t",164.40000000000001,137.43489999999986,332.03400000000011,149.8368999999999,9,false],["expect them to live the Christian life yet.",164.40000000000001,150.43089999999984,317.6880000000001,162.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,175.8368999999999,9,false],["Idea: Small groups in a Los Angeles church throw",164.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,350.88900000000007,175.8368999999999,9,false],["a party once a month. The Christians in the group",164.40000000000001,176.43089999999984,351.7530000000001,188.83289999999988,9,false],["invite their non-Christian friends, allowing",164.40000000000001,189.42689999999982,328.88400000000001,201.82889999999986,9,false],["relationships to form with other Christians.",164.40000000000001,202.4228999999998,330.19800000000009,214.82489999999984,9,false],["4. Tell them",146.40000000000001,228.09089999999981,196.28700000000001,241.47389999999984,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,253.8368999999999,9,false],["Tell them your story of the difference Christ has",164.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,345.93000000000012,253.8368999999999,9,false],["made in your life.",164.40000000000001,254.43089999999984,229.97399999999999,266.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,279.8368999999999,9,false],["Invite them to church or to an outreach event.",164.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,337.66800000000001,279.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,280.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,292.83689999999996,9,false],["Ask if anyone has explained to them what it",164.40000000000001,280.43489999999997,328.61400000000009,292.83689999999996,9,false],["means to be a true Christian. Let them know how",164.40000000000001,293.43089999999995,349.96199999999999,305.83289999999994,9,false],["to begin a relationship with God.",164.40000000000001,306.42689999999993,287.673,318.82889999999992,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Begin an investigative Bible study of the Gospel",164.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,343.87800000000004,331.83689999999996,9,false],["of John. Lead them to Christ as you sense they",164.40000000000001,332.43089999999995,339.25200000000007,344.83289999999994,9,false],["are ready.",164.40000000000001,345.42689999999993,201.012,357.82889999999992,9,false],["REAL LIFE STORY",146.40000000000001,377.81989999999996,218.98000000000002,398.35989999999998,20,false],["Damon and Andrea were involved in Campus Crusade",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,350.87100000000009,409.83689999999996,9,false],["in college. After graduating they got married, and",146.40000000000001,410.43089999999995,331.48500000000001,422.83289999999994,9,false],["Damon went to medical school while Andrea got a job.",146.40000000000001,423.42689999999993,350.41200000000015,435.82889999999992,9,false],["After becoming involved in a church, they helped give",146.40000000000001,449.42789999999991,348.71100000000013,461.8298999999999,9,false],["leadership to a church-based campus ministry with",146.40000000000001,462.42389999999989,341.3490000000001,474.82589999999988,9,false],["students attending from two universities. They also",146.40000000000001,475.41989999999987,341.60100000000011,487.82189999999986,9,false],["got to know another couple from Damon’s class in",146.40000000000001,488.41589999999985,334.48200000000008,500.81789999999984,9,false],["medical school.",146.40000000000001,501.41189999999983,205.251,513.81389999999988,9,false],["R E L AT I O N A L",43.841199999999994,572.95800000000008,57.071200000000005,620.97800000000007,7,false],["E VA N G E L I S M 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,569.98299999999995,9,false],["They prayed for this couple, took them to church,",146.40000000000001,527.41289999999981,332.07900000000006,539.81489999999985,9,false],["and spent time with them. After several months,",146.40000000000001,540.4088999999999,328.71300000000008,552.81089999999983,9,false],["their friends received Christ. Because they had a",146.40000000000001,553.40489999999977,329.73900000000015,565.80689999999981,9,false],["relationship with Damon and Andrea (and with the",146.40000000000001,566.40089999999987,339.99900000000014,578.80289999999991,9,false],["church), it was natural for the new couple to receive",146.40000000000001,579.39689999999985,342.49200000000008,591.79889999999989,9,false],["follow-up and become involved in the church.",146.40000000000001,592.39289999999983,318.89400000000006,604.79489999999987,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",192.9309998,764.7502197,419.06899980000003,778.53021969999998,10,false]],"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612}]}